{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123787","id":4621980095,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABE33Rvw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123787","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123787.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123787.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123787","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123787/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123787/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123787/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/100ba97cf319f1b20a62daf05f8918b8c8377f1b","number":123787,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[Web] Sync playback rate when restarting audio sample","user":{"login":"jgill88","id":10379307,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5MzA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379307?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88","html_url":"https://github.com/jgill88","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #123786\r\n\r\nFixes bugs wrt pitch scale in web sample playback:\r\n\r\n1. When an AudioStreamPlayer loops, pitch_scale is reset to 1.0. \r\n2. pitch_scale is ignored when an AudioStreamPlayer with autoplay=true begins playing upon enteringg tree\r\n\r\nBoth bugs are fixed by the same change in _restart, but are actually separate broken codepaths. I discovered the autoplay bug while preparing a MRP for the loop bug :) \r\n\r\n**Loop bug:**\r\n\r\n_restart doesn't sync playback rate for the newly created AudioBufferSourceNode.\r\n\r\n**Autoplay bug:**\r\n\r\nAfter a little bit of stepping through the debugger to confirm my original fix, I found that SampleNode _unpause unconditionally calls _restart, even if the stream is not paused. This unconditional _restart call is what previously also clobbered the pitch_scale for autoplay=true.\r\n\r\nIt looks like SampleNode _intended to_ support autoplay via the options.start bool in the ctor, via the `connectPositionWorklet(start)` call - but this ends up being a little racy and _restart seems to win - and so fixing _restart also fixes the autoplay bug, since _restart is actually what's autoplaying the sample.\r\n\r\n```\r\nEnter tree flow\r\n(i just annotated stack trace from the debugger)\r\n\r\n_restart (tmp_js_export.js:1)\r\n^^^^^ disregards stream playback rate\r\n\r\n_unpause (tmp_js_export.js:1)\r\n^^^^^ Unconditionally calls _restart\r\n\r\n    pause (tmp_js_export.js:1)\r\n    pauseSampleNode (tmp_js_export.js:1)\r\n    sample_set_pause (tmp_js_export.js:1)\r\n\r\n_godot_audio_sample_set_pause (tmp_js_export.js:1)\r\n^^^^ AudioDriverWeb::set_sample_playback_pause(.., p_pause=!node->can_process())\r\nAudioStreamPlayerInternal::notification(p_what=Node::NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE)\r\n\r\n\r\nAutoplay:\r\n\r\nstart (tmp_js_export.js:1)\r\n^^^^ at this point, the stream is already playing due to the broken _unpause method,  triggered by the enter tree flow\r\n\r\n    connectPositionWorklet (tmp_js_export.js:1)\r\n    await in connectPositionWorklet\r\n    SampleNode (tmp_js_export.js:1)\r\n    create (tmp_js_export.js:1)\r\n    start_sample (tmp_js_export.js:1)\r\n\r\n_godot_audio_sample_start (tmp_js_export.js:1)\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nSince creation of a new source requires setting the playback rate, I've deduplicated the creation of this source and used it in the two relevant places. \r\n\r\nI know the _unpause change is perhaps slightly off topic, so if that's a problem I'm happy to remove it - but it was directly discovered by the _restart bug.\r\n\r\nno ai was used at all. ","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","